Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Enables NVIDIA GPU performance-counter access for all users (not just admin),
; which Nsight Compute (ncu) needs to profile on a GeForce card (RTX 3050).
; Right-click this file -> Merge (accept the UAC prompt), then REBOOT.
; To undo, set the value back to 1 (or delete it).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\nvlddmkm\Global\NVTweak]
"RmProfilingAdminOnly"=dword:00000000
